<title>USA: Omaha hogs up $.25 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs up $.25 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts $.25 higher. Top</p>
<p>$59.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    230-260 lbs    59.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    260-280 lbs    58.00-58.50</p>
<p>Sows: Compared with Tuesday's close, prices steady. Top</p>
<p>$53.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    350-450 lbs    48.50-49.00</p>
<p>	    450-500 lbs    50.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    500-650 lbs    52.00-53.00</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Hogs:  600	 Sltr - 600     Fdrs - None</p>
